From bb7f06dac2179a4911242decf23e92a771fb3cf9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Oct 2025 18:50:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add cc2cc MCP server for Claude Code session management

Implements a comprehensive MCP server that enables a Claude Code instance
to create and manage other Claude Code sessions with the following features:

- Session lifecycle management (create, start, monitor, terminate, cleanup)
- Git worktree isolation for parallel development
- Process management for Claude Code sub-agents
- Full MCP integration with 7 tools
- 53 comprehensive unit and integration tests
- Modular architecture with clear separation of concerns
- Type-safe with Pydantic models
- Self-documenting code following best practices

Architecture:
- models.py: Pydantic data models for sessions and configuration
- worktree.py: Git worktree creation and management
- process.py: Async process management for Claude Code instances
- session.py: High-level session orchestration
- server.py: MCP server implementation with tool handlers

Test coverage includes unit tests for all components plus integration
tests for the full MCP server workflow.

Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
